# Noctalia plugin payloads are installed/reinstallable via the plugin manager
# (see noctalia/plugins.json for the enabled sources) - too large/binary to track.
# Note: can't ignore noctalia/plugins/ itself, git won't recurse into an
# excluded directory so the settings.json negation below wouldn't apply.
noctalia/plugins/*/*
# ...but each plugin's own settings.json is real user config, so track those.
!noctalia/plugins/*/settings.json
